        <div class="seg b1">Split your funding<small>taxable or not</small></div>
        <div class="seg b2">Estimate the tax<small>with no withholding</small></div>
        <div class="seg b3">Catch the traps<small>Kiddie and quarterly</small></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="stat-grid">
    <div class="stat"><div class="n">$2,700</div><div class="l">unearned income above this can trigger the Kiddie Tax</div><div class="src">IRS, 2026</div></div>
